      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just wait for the new gen of video cards and for people to upgrade their cpus, a lot of these problems will probably go away.\n\nOn another note, atlasing may work for some models but realistically many models only use a few actual shaders/materials so I don't quite understand why you want to squash a minority of people.",
